tation_note":"恢傳末世子範繼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"a-liang043-si-fan","subject_person_id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_AABA","object_person_id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_AAB","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"範遣世子嗣","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-022","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-022-xiaofan-si","source_id":"s-liangshu-022-xiaofan-si-ws1513347","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-022-xiaofan-si:p002","quote":"及景圍京邑，範遣世子嗣與裴之高等入援，","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-022-xiaofan-si:p002:m0010","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-022-xiaofan-si:p002:m0006"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"嗣是範子。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-liangshu-043-weican-3-3","title":"安北將軍","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_AAB","attestations":[{"id":"th-liangshu-043-weican-3-3:a","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-043-weican:p003","start":3,"end":7,"surface":"安北將軍","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-043-weican:p003:m0010","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-043","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-043-weican","source_id":"s-liangshu-043-weican-ws2087360","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-043-weican:p003","quote":"先是，安北將軍鄱陽王範亦自合肥遣西豫州刺史裴之高與其長子嗣，帥江西之衆赴京師，屯於張公洲，待上流諸軍至。是時，之高遣船渡仲禮，與合軍進屯王游苑。粲建議推仲禮爲大都督，報下流衆軍。裴之高自以年位恥居其下，乃云：「柳節下是州將，何須我復鞭板？」累日不決。粲乃抗言於衆曰：「今者同赴國難，義在除賊，所以推柳司州者，政以久捍邊疆，先爲侯景所憚；且士馬精銳，無出其前。若論位次，柳在粲下；語其年齒，亦少於粲，直以社稷之計，不得復論。今日形勢，貴在將和；若人心不同，大事去矣。裴公朝之舊齒，年德已隆，豈應復挾私情，以沮大計。粲請爲諸君解釋之。」乃單舸至之高營，切讓之曰：「前諸將之議，豫州意所未同，卽二宮危逼，猾寇滔天，臣子當戮力同心，豈可自相矛盾！豫州必欲立異，鋒鏑便有所歸。」之高垂泣曰：「吾荷國恩榮，自應帥先士卒，顧恨衰老，不能效命，企望柳使君共平凶逆，謂衆議已從，無俟老夫耳。若必有疑，當剖心相示。」於是諸將定議，仲禮方得進軍。","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-043-weican:p003:m0010"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載